===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{context|intransitive|lang=en}} To behave [[dramatically]] or [[showily]] to [[impress]] an [[audience]] or observers; to [[pander]] to a crowd.
#:''Many politicians prefer to '''grandstand''' on hot-button issues rather than enact tough policy changes.''

